{"id": "EUVD-2026-103039", "enisaUuid": "86bfddea-8a80-3374-b3e3-c5437a7ff6f4", "description": "WHartTest through 2.8.1 contains a missing authentication vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to connect to the /ws/ui/web/ and /ws/ui/actuator/ WebSocket endpoints because UiAutomationConsumer accepts every connection. Attackers can register an actuator with a client-supplied id to intercept other users' test-case payloads, receive broadcast step results, and spoof results and screen frames into victim sessions.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:38:55", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T19:28:17", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/wharttest-ui-automation-websocket-missing-authentication", "https://github.com/MGdaasLab/WHartTest/blob/v2.8.1/WHartTest_Django/wharttest_django/asgi.py#L41-L53", "https://github.com/MGdaasLab/WHartTest/blob/v2.8.1/WHartTest_Django/ui_automation/consumers.py#L129-L186", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/wharttest-through-2.8.1-missing-authentication-on-ui-automation-websocket-endpoints"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111617", "GHSA-6gwv-fx4p-w9x8"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.41, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "8e4ff968-a070-3b15-ad3a-ebb79d0816e7", "product": {"name": "WHartTest", "vendor": {"name": "MGdaasLab"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22642.8.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "1fb6b72b-df38-322b-b95f-d987cf5faa9e", "vendor": {"name": "MGdaasLab"}}], "isExploited": false}